# Listing page

This is an original desktop listing UI. Do not copy another site's source.

- Keep listing content at 1120px. Gallery is 480px tall with an 8px gap.
- Primary text is `#222222`. The reserve and search actions use `#ff385c`.
- Photos, the photo tour, and the lightbox all read the `photos` array from `GET /api/listing`.
- Escape closes only the top overlay. Restore focus to the trigger.
- Do not add a mobile layout unless asked.
